(5409386, 776877, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great night shot. I love how the water has that glistening silvery green. Nice.</td>', 'Great night shot. I love how the water has that glistening silvery green. Nice.', '2009-03-30 23:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
