(5409401, 776835, 15711, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this, the more I like it.  You know what I like best?  That I can see her eyelashes so clearly. I can see this on the cover of an album too.</td>', 'The more I look at this, the more I like it.  You know what I like best?  That I can see her eyelashes so clearly. I can see this on the cover of an album too.', '2009-03-31 00:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409404, 777315, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sea scape.  Simple yet perfectly focused.  Loving the colors and richness overall.</td>', 'Beautiful sea scape.  Simple yet perfectly focused.  Loving the colors and richness overall.', '2009-03-31 00:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409407, 776844, 15711, '<td valign="top">Her blurred hand in the foreground is a touch distracting.  I wish there were more tonal range.  Perhaps playing with curves and/or levels might achieve that.  As is, only her eyes have much variation in grey scale.</td>', 'Her blurred hand in the foreground is a touch distracting.  I wish there were more tonal range.  Perhaps playing with curves and/or levels might achieve that.  As is, only her eyes have much variation in grey scale.', '2009-03-31 00:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
