(5409550, 777181, 32108, '<td valign="top">I know how hard it is to keep detail in dark clothing on a black BG, well done. Plus the fact that it is ''different'' scores well from me. Maybe just a tad sharper would have got another point.</td>', 'I know how hard it is to keep detail in dark clothing on a black BG, well done. Plus the fact that it is ''different'' scores well from me. Maybe just a tad sharper would have got another point.', '2009-03-31 02:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
