(5409680, 777380, 100773, '<td valign="top">The idea is very good, but I think you could limit this photo alot. Girl dancing in a soft lit room may be brilliant and get bunch of 6 and 7. This doesn''t quite make it there, due to disturbing background and to small motive in my oppinion. Also, the backside of a girl/boy, any person or animal is not that excitiing. Sometimes it may though.</td>', 'The idea is very good, but I think you could limit this photo alot. Girl dancing in a soft lit room may be brilliant and get bunch of 6 and 7. This doesn''t quite make it there, due to disturbing background and to small motive in my oppinion. Also, the backside of a girl/boy, any person or animal is not that excitiing. Sometimes it may though.', '2009-03-31 08:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
