(5413754, 777114, 96534, '<td valign="top">the idea is really promising, but there''s a few things that you could do to make it a winner. The pie probably shouldn''t be cut, its a bit gooey in the middle, the lighting could come more from the side, rather than the front, and the placement of the pie could be less dead centre. Only in my humble opinion, I wish I could get mine right too! Hope it was yummy!</td>', 'the idea is really promising, but there''s a few things that you could do to make it a winner. The pie probably shouldn''t be cut, its a bit gooey in the middle, the lighting could come more from the side, rather than the front, and the placement of the pie could be less dead centre. Only in my humble opinion, I wish I could get mine right too! Hope it was yummy!', '2009-04-01 22:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
