(5415737, 777289, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but could use a bit more post processing to make it pop.</td>', 'nice idea, but could use a bit more post processing to make it pop.', '2009-04-02 20:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5415738, 777382, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, decent exposure, forced composition.</td>', 'nice idea, decent exposure, forced composition.', '2009-04-02 20:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5415740, 776735, 23394, '<td valign="top">sorry, but boring composition, especially splitting the image in the middle.  could have used either some serious foreground or some sky.  or you could have waited for a bird (or even brought some bread to attract some birds).  as is, just boring.</td>', 'sorry, but boring composition, especially splitting the image in the middle.  could have used either some serious foreground or some sky.  or you could have waited for a bird (or even brought some bread to attract some birds).  as is, just boring.', '2009-04-02 20:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5415742, 777499, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but i don''t think it works too well.  maybe if you''d found a better set of steps?  the softness is ok, but that lightpole just kills it.</td>', 'nice idea, but i don''t think it works too well.  maybe if you''d found a better set of steps?  the softness is ok, but that lightpole just kills it.', '2009-04-02 20:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5415744, 777195, 23394, '<td valign="top">there''s a LOT going on here, and i can''t believe it was all planned.  it would probably be a lot more interesting without the ship in the background. i''d make an argument for a longer lens and shooting tighter on just the fishermen and the couple--that would make for an interesting juxtaposition.</td>', 'there''s a LOT going on here, and i can''t believe it was all planned.  it would probably be a lot more interesting without the ship in the background. i''d make an argument for a longer lens and shooting tighter on just the fishermen and the couple--that would make for an interesting juxtaposition.', '2009-04-02 20:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
