(5418098, 777181, 23394, '<td valign="top">too much contrast, needs more details in the shadows.  that blond hair is just screaming.  the stuff on her face is a real distraction (i call it that because it doesn''t serve any apparent purpose other than to make me go ''huh?'')</td>', 'too much contrast, needs more details in the shadows.  that blond hair is just screaming.  the stuff on her face is a real distraction (i call it that because it doesn''t serve any apparent purpose other than to make me go ''huh?'')', '2009-04-04 06:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
