(5418107, 777369, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great expression, simple color pallette is very striking, nice exposure to balance detail in her dark hair and eyes without blowing out the background. I like the crop and framing as you have it. Great shot. My favorite so far.</td>', 'Great expression, simple color pallette is very striking, nice exposure to balance detail in her dark hair and eyes without blowing out the background. I like the crop and framing as you have it. Great shot. My favorite so far.', '2009-04-04 07:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
