(5418422, 777477, 100773, '<td valign="top">I would like to see a more cleraly indication of time in this shot. Your black and white performance is excellent.</td>', 'I would like to see a more cleraly indication of time in this shot. Your black and white performance is excellent.', '2009-04-04 12:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5418427, 777161, 100773, '<td valign="top">Oh man... I''ve been trying to photograph wild life for a year, and some of you guys manage to capture something for a rock title challenge. Unfair! His bloody eyes looks like they''re on fire too.... 7</td>', 'Oh man... I''ve been trying to photograph wild life for a year, and some of you guys manage to capture something for a rock title challenge. Unfair! His bloody eyes looks like they''re on fire too.... 7', '2009-04-04 12:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5418431, 777181, 100773, '<td valign="top">My guess is that you won''t need me to say that this was a hell of a good shot. Detail and clarity, suberb! I don''t get those black dots in her face though, but they are somewhat suitable. Nicely done!</td>', 'My guess is that you won''t need me to say that this was a hell of a good shot. Detail and clarity, suberb! I don''t get those black dots in her face though, but they are somewhat suitable. Nicely done!', '2009-04-04 12:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5418443, 777605, 100773, '<td valign="top">I don''t believe her eyes, such clarity! One COULD say that there''s to much blue in this photo. You can''t do something with her eyes, obviously, but I think you would extend the beauty of this photo by changing the background color and the color of her clothing. Maybe even check out the high-key technique. Imagine the clarity of her eyes then! Also, her chin appears almost saturated. Could add more light to that part of her face so the colors in her face wouldn''t fade. Just a thought!</td>', 'I don''t believe her eyes, such clarity! One COULD say that there''s to much blue in this photo. You can''t do something with her eyes, obviously, but I think you would extend the beauty of this photo by changing the background color and the color of her clothing. Maybe even check out the high-key technique. Imagine the clarity of her eyes then! Also, her chin appears almost saturated. Could add more light to that part of her face so the colors in her face wouldn''t fade. Just a thought!', '2009-04-04 12:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5418447, 777125, 100773, '<td valign="top">I was wondering if anyone would try this title. I would say you succeded! Great work!</td>', 'I was wondering if anyone would try this title. I would say you succeded! Great work!', '2009-04-04 12:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5418449, 777331, 100773, '<td valign="top">Why the childtoy looking keyboard in the back? I would apreciate this much more without it. But that just might be me!</td>', 'Why the childtoy looking keyboard in the back? I would apreciate this much more without it. But that just might be me!', '2009-04-04 12:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5418453, 777374, 100773, '<td valign="top">A bit funny. Even cute.</td>', 'A bit funny. Even cute.', '2009-04-04 12:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
