(5418502, 776122, 90414, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and apple reflections, just not sure if you meant to catch your own reflection: it competes with the subject.</td>', 'Great lighting and apple reflections, just not sure if you meant to catch your own reflection: it competes with the subject.', '2009-04-04 13:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5418531, 777163, 100773, '<td valign="top">That was a very disturbing and scary picture. Could easily fit as an albumcover. Her good eye looks like some..thing... SCARY!!!</td>', 'That was a very disturbing and scary picture. Could easily fit as an albumcover. Her good eye looks like some..thing... SCARY!!!', '2009-04-04 14:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5418534, 777588, 100773, '<td valign="top">Nice angle! But I think some fill-light would help. To much shadow perhaps.</td>', 'Nice angle! But I think some fill-light would help. To much shadow perhaps.', '2009-04-04 14:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5418536, 776374, 100773, '<td valign="top">Have to be sharper</td>', 'Have to be sharper', '2009-04-04 14:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5418541, 776762, 100773, '<td valign="top">There''s a rock title challenge and you get lightning.... Lucy bas... man... Great capture of the lightning! But did you add some effect filter on this, or is it noise? Will read your imagedetail when the challenge is over. And of the record, you know you have some talent when you''re able to capture lightning ;)</td>', 'There''s a rock title challenge and you get lightning.... Lucy bas... man... Great capture of the lightning! But did you add some effect filter on this, or is it noise? Will read your imagedetail when the challenge is over. And of the record, you know you have some talent when you''re able to capture lightning ;)', '2009-04-04 14:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5418547, 777092, 100773, '<td valign="top">Not to familiar with Marilyn Manson, but this looks like something that would fit a title of his. Lighting works fine as it is in this photo, usually I''m a sucker for a fill light if shadows, or an entire shadowed part (hopefully you know what I mean...). It also looks like your modell is standing very close to the background. Could be a bit improved if she had stayed further away.</td>', 'Not to familiar with Marilyn Manson, but this looks like something that would fit a title of his. Lighting works fine as it is in this photo, usually I''m a sucker for a fill light if shadows, or an entire shadowed part (hopefully you know what I mean...). It also looks like your modell is standing very close to the background. Could be a bit improved if she had stayed further away.', '2009-04-04 14:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5418582, 777212, 100773, '<td valign="top">Should at leat be a yellow taxi in this photo</td>', 'Should at leat be a yellow taxi in this photo', '2009-04-04 14:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
