(5418943, 777381, 103069, '<td valign="top">I knew the name of the song before reading the title, you were able to communicate very effectively with your photo.   Very good for the topic.</td>', 'I knew the name of the song before reading the title, you were able to communicate very effectively with your photo.   Very good for the topic.', '2009-04-04 20:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
