(5418964, 777092, 9411, '<td valign="top">great shot, love the darkness and tilt of the head... she looking at the cop?</td>', 'great shot, love the darkness and tilt of the head... she looking at the cop?', '2009-04-04 20:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5418965, 777104, 9411, '<td valign="top">OK, points for humor! not often ya see the "slap dance" portrayed so well</td>', 'OK, points for humor! not often ya see the "slap dance" portrayed so well', '2009-04-04 20:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5419056, 777406, 72670, '<td valign="top">Normally I am not a big fan of photos of statues, but this one has much more potential. I would have chosen a different perspective, one without the buildings. Maybe from the ground up with just the sky and this guy. Apply the same processing as you have done here and add a sky with drama and it would score well.</td>', 'Normally I am not a big fan of photos of statues, but this one has much more potential. I would have chosen a different perspective, one without the buildings. Maybe from the ground up with just the sky and this guy. Apply the same processing as you have done here and add a sky with drama and it would score well.', '2009-04-04 22:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5419062, 776879, 72670, '<td valign="top">Very <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=36988" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Qart</a>ish. Excellent effort. However, it just falls short of pics that are similar. The sharpness isn''t there,the white isn''t quite the same and the texture in the features are lacking. Still a nice pic.7</td>', 'Very  Qartish. Excellent effort. However, it just falls short of pics that are similar. The sharpness isn''t there,the white isn''t quite the same and the texture in the features are lacking. Still a nice pic.7', '2009-04-04 22:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5419068, 777583, 72670, '<td valign="top">I first time I heard this song was just the other day.And then this appears! Nice processing to draw the attention to the centre of the image, not that it needed it. Normally I wouldn''t care about the choice of undies but some nice lace would make this for me.The Aqua and yellow are a little too much.IMO</td>', 'I first time I heard this song was just the other day.And then this appears! Nice processing to draw the attention to the centre of the image, not that it needed it. Normally I wouldn''t care about the choice of undies but some nice lace would make this for me.The Aqua and yellow are a little too much.IMO', '2009-04-04 22:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5419198, 777475, 22301, '<td valign="top">excellent portrait and light, hope this does well</td>', 'excellent portrait and light, hope this does well', '2009-04-05 01:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
