(5419866, 777517, 86447, '<td valign="top">Freaky.  At first, it looks like her head''s on backwards.  I think she''s probably a bunch prettier than this makes her seem... with so much whites showing in her eyes and the odd pose.  I''m sorry... I''m just telling the truth AS I SEE IT.    It''s got great color. (not voting)</td>', 'Freaky.  At first, it looks like her head''s on backwards.  I think she''s probably a bunch prettier than this makes her seem... with so much whites showing in her eyes and the odd pose.  I''m sorry... I''m just telling the truth AS I SEE IT.    It''s got great color. (not voting)', '2009-04-05 18:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5419868, 776416, 86447, '<td valign="top">John Mayer - Hummingbird 1971   :)<br/> <br/>Nice and sharp.  Good job with the shutter speed.</td>', 'John Mayer - Hummingbird 1971   :) Nice and sharp.  Good job with the shutter speed.', '2009-04-05 18:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
