(5420896, 776879, 34938, '<td valign="top">An amazing image...I guess I was wrong about the need for a validation. I thought it looked a bit sketched...but, I was wrong. I gave it an 8...my apologies for doubting it, but I was just being pecautionary. Congrats...well deserved ribbon and a stunning image</td>', 'An amazing image...I guess I was wrong about the need for a validation. I thought it looked a bit sketched...but, I was wrong. I gave it an 8...my apologies for doubting it, but I was just being pecautionary. Congrats...well deserved ribbon and a stunning image', '2009-04-06 02:08:08.000000', NULL, 0),
