(5420973, 776835, 91197, '<td valign="top">What a pity, George! This was one of my favorites. Congrats anyway.<br/> <br/>In my opinion this photo <b>does not fool</b> the voters into thinking that the photographer actually captured the moon at the time of this capture.<br/> <br/>As I see it, this is not a realistic shot. The careful viewer may easily realize, that the relevant size between the <b>girl</b>''s figure and the <b>moon </b>is unnatural. <b>Not to mention the DOF</b>!!! It s a setup!  Thats why this one should not be disqualified because the careful viewer easily realizes that either the moon or the girl is a fake. The photo does not fool the voters into thinking that the photographer actually captured the original photograph at the time of this capture.<br/> <br/>In conclusion if this is a single capture, then in my opinion <b>its legal according the advance editing rules </b>and should not be disqualified.</td>', 'What a pity, George! This was one of my favorites. Congrats anyway. In my opinion this photo does not fool the voters into thinking that the photographer actually captured the moon at the time of this capture. As I see it, this is not a realistic shot. The careful viewer may easily realize, that the relevant size between the girl''s figure and the moon is unnatural. Not to mention the DOF!!! It s a setup!  Thats why this one should not be disqualified because the careful viewer easily realizes that either the moon or the girl is a fake. The photo does not fool the voters into thinking that the photographer actually captured the original photograph at the time of this capture. In conclusion if this is a single capture, then in my opinion its legal according the advance editing rules and should not be disqualified.', '2009-04-06 03:08:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5420975, 776636, 34938, '<td valign="top">Wow Andrew...you are really on a roll here...this is awesome. I thought it was <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=67145" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">roz</a> <br/> <br/>well done, and give my regards to Singapore</td>', 'Wow Andrew...you are really on a roll here...this is awesome. I thought it was  roz  well done, and give my regards to Singapore', '2009-04-06 03:18:29.000000', NULL, 0),
