(5421010, 776075, 23002, '<td valign="top">This is one of the finest macro shots I have seen on the site.  I did not vote on this challenge because I entered it, but when I seen it I actually wondered if it was a real fly because it was so perfect.  The yellow with the hairs coming out looked almost like stitches on a stuffed fly or something. I think the selective desat also made it seem surreal to me.  I have never been a fan of that technique, but it certainly makes your fly stand out from the background.  I mean that as a compliment, that it looked so incredible it was hard to imagine that it was real.  Great work and congrats on an amazing image. :)</td>', 'This is one of the finest macro shots I have seen on the site.  I did not vote on this challenge because I entered it, but when I seen it I actually wondered if it was a real fly because it was so perfect.  The yellow with the hairs coming out looked almost like stitches on a stuffed fly or something. I think the selective desat also made it seem surreal to me.  I have never been a fan of that technique, but it certainly makes your fly stand out from the background.  I mean that as a compliment, that it looked so incredible it was hard to imagine that it was real.  Great work and congrats on an amazing image. :)', '2009-04-06 03:55:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5421012, 777342, 67145, '<td valign="top">i looked thru this challenge altho i didnt vote and this one just blew me away .. thought it would get the blue for sure .. its the right colour too .. !!!!!<br/>it''s the most stunning image .. so incredibly beautiful &amp; the patterns are exquisite .. <br/>i just dont understand why this didnt beat that ugly old fly .. !! .. :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'i looked thru this challenge altho i didnt vote and this one just blew me away .. thought it would get the blue for sure .. its the right colour too .. !!!!!it''s the most stunning image .. so incredibly beautiful & the patterns are exquisite .. i just dont understand why this didnt beat that ugly old fly .. !! .. :) ', '2009-04-06 03:58:02.000000', NULL, 0),
