(5429114, 777104, 44877, '<td valign="top">This is a riot - love it! Your POV is great, too. Very creative. <br/> <br/>Based on your own comment down there - if I may suggest - I think some selective lightening of the guy in the back would have helped. Your background is brighter than your subjects and that could have affected the score. <br/> <br/>For inside shots like that, I use this very fast Canon EF 50mm f/1.8 II - best (small) investment ever. I''m also not fond of flash and avoid it like the plague.</td>', 'This is a riot - love it! Your POV is great, too. Very creative.  Based on your own comment down there - if I may suggest - I think some selective lightening of the guy in the back would have helped. Your background is brighter than your subjects and that could have affected the score.  For inside shots like that, I use this very fast Canon EF 50mm f/1.8 II - best (small) investment ever. I''m also not fond of flash and avoid it like the plague.', '2009-04-09 12:02:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5429387, 776432, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!</td>', 'This is beautiful!', '2009-04-09 14:19:12.000000', NULL, 0),
