(5436980, 777315, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I just realized you and Bear used the same title.  Very different interpretations!  This is a gorgeous shot - beautifully processed as well.</td>', 'LOL!  I just realized you and Bear used the same title.  Very different interpretations!  This is a gorgeous shot - beautifully processed as well.', '2009-04-14 16:28:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5440036, 777580, 30982, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the rocks appear as smudges - they appear as rocks under the surface to me... but as you''ve undoubtedly figured out by now, speed voters don''t usually stop to see what they''re looking at sometimes.  And I got a comment that Janis Joplin isn''t rock either.... kids these days, I tell ya....</td>', 'I don''t think the rocks appear as smudges - they appear as rocks under the surface to me... but as you''ve undoubtedly figured out by now, speed voters don''t usually stop to see what they''re looking at sometimes.  And I got a comment that Janis Joplin isn''t rock either.... kids these days, I tell ya....', '2009-04-16 08:19:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5442384, 777066, 70484, '<td valign="top">I love this!!!</td>', 'I love this!!!', '2009-04-17 20:15:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5447518, 777196, 23484, '<td valign="top">Wow, that really brings out the detail.</td>', 'Wow, that really brings out the detail.', '2009-04-21 21:51:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5456367, 777212, 60862, '<td valign="top">Well, *I* got the reference immediately, and it''s apt!  Thanks for the wiki link - interesting reading about one of my favorite songs.</td>', 'Well, *I* got the reference immediately, and it''s apt!  Thanks for the wiki link - interesting reading about one of my favorite songs.', '2009-04-29 01:15:29.000000', NULL, 0),
