(5538470, 777554, 107943, '<td valign="top">That''s hot Leo....nice tat. ;)</td>', 'That''s hot Leo....nice tat. ;)', '2009-06-21 16:19:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5682582, 777212, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nope. It definitely doesn''t suck. It''s truly an awesome picture and very well done. I noticed in this challenge (and the book title challenge) that people weren''t looking for pictures that were about the idea or theme of the song or the book. The just wanted a picture the represented the actual words of the title. So since there was no taxi, I think you got majorly hit hard. (However, I love the song and know the meaning, so I gave you a 7.)<br/> <br/>It would be fun to have a book jacket or song challenge, where the picture is actually a scene from the book or song. But I suppose it would be hard to vote on if you didn''t know the book or song...</td>', 'Nope. It definitely doesn''t suck. It''s truly an awesome picture and very well done. I noticed in this challenge (and the book title challenge) that people weren''t looking for pictures that were about the idea or theme of the song or the book. The just wanted a picture the represented the actual words of the title. So since there was no taxi, I think you got majorly hit hard. (However, I love the song and know the meaning, so I gave you a 7.) It would be fun to have a book jacket or song challenge, where the picture is actually a scene from the book or song. But I suppose it would be hard to vote on if you didn''t know the book or song...', '2009-10-10 11:59:01.000000', NULL, 0),
